enter][/cell][cell bg=#classe_clair border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]fin[b][color=#C62828]issez[/color][/b][/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe_clair border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]grand[b][color=#C62828]issez[/color][/b][/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20][b]ils, elles[/b][/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]fin[b][color=#C62828]issent[/color][/b][/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]grand[b][color=#C62828]issent[/color][/b][/font_size][/center][/cell][/table]
[page]
[titre]Le reconnaître[/titre]
[cadre]Un verbe se conjugue comme finir si on dit « nous [b]…issons[/b] ».
nous chois[b]issons[/b] · nous roug[b]issons[/b] · nous applaud[b]issons[/b] ✓[/cadre]
[cadre=astuce]Pièges : il fini[b]t[/b] (et pas « il finis »), nous finissons (avec ss).[/cadre]
[page]
[titre]Aller et venir[/titre]
[table=3][cell bg=#classe border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][color=white][/color][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][color=white][b]aller[/b][/color][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][color=white][b]venir[/b][/color][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe_clair border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20][b]je[/b][/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe_clair border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]vais[/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe_clair border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]viens[/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20][b]tu[/b][/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]vas[/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]viens[/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe_clair border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20][b]il, elle[/b][/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe_clair border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]va[/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe_clair border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]vient[/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20][b]nous[/b][/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]allons[/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]venons[/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe_clair border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20][b]vous[/b][/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe_clair border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]allez[/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#classe_clair border=#classe padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]venez[/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20][b]ils, elles[/b][/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]vont[/font_size][/center][/cell][cell bg=#C6E2F8 border=#42A5F5 padding=10,4,10,4][center][font_size=20]viennent[/font_size][/center][/cell][/table]
[cadre]Ce ne sont pas des verbes comme finir : il faut les apprendre.[/cadre]
